## 5. OpenTelemetry — traces and span attributes

### 5.1 Span **names** (OTel: not high cardinality)

Use **static** span names: `llm.gemini.invoke`, `audio.transcribe`, `http.server.request`.

Put dynamic bits in **attributes**, not in the span name string.

### 5.2 Recommended **attributes** (mirror logs/metrics)

| Attribute | Example |
|-----------|---------|
| `service.name` | OTel resource |
| `deployment.environment` | resource |
| `llm.model_id` | span attribute |
| `llm.module` | span attribute |
| `llm.function` | span attribute |
| `gen_ai.system` | `vertex_ai` / `gemini` (see OTel GenAI semconv drafts if you adopt them) |
| `gen_ai.request.model` | if using emerging conventions |

**Child spans:** Under one `trace_id`, chain `Pass1` → `Pass2` as child spans with `llm.pass_index` attribute.

