## 6. Kubernetes — labels and annotations

### 6.1 **Labels** (selector / scheduling; keep small and stable)

| Key | Value example | Use |
|-----|----------------|-----|
| `app.kubernetes.io/name` | `voice-api` | Standard K8s |
| `app.kubernetes.io/component` | `worker` | |
| `app.kubernetes.io/instance` | `voice-api-prod-sgp` | |
| `tags.datadoghq.com/env` | `prod` | If using Datadog tags style |
| `tags.datadoghq.com/service` | `voice-api` | |

### 6.2 **Annotations** (metadata, not selectors)

| Key | Value |
|-----|--------|
| `prometheus.io/scrape` | `true` |
| `prometheus.io/port` | `8080` |
| `prometheus.io/path` | `/metrics` |

Do not duplicate high-cardinality data in labels; use annotations or external CMDB.

