## 7. Grafana — variables and dashboard tags

| Concept | Naming |
|---------|--------|
| Dashboard **tag** | `service:voice-api`, `team:platform`, `domain:llm` |
| **Template variable** | `$environment`, `$service`, `$region` — match Prometheus label names exactly |
| **Folder** | `Prod / Voice` or `LLM / Cost` |

---

## 8. Correlation — one story across systems

| ID | Where |
|----|--------|
| **trace_id** | OTel trace, log `trace.id`, optional HTTP header propagation |
| **span_id** | OTel, log `span.id` |
| **request_id** / **correlation_id** | HTTP header `X-Request-Id`, log field `http.request.id` or custom |
| **flow_id** | Business pipeline (e.g. dual audio pass) — **logs + traces**; link to metrics via **exemplars** if you use Prometheus exemplars on histograms |

**Log line at LLM exit must contain:** `trace.id` + `llm.flow_id` + `service.name` so Kibana → trace UI works.

