## 10. Quick reference card (copy-paste)

```
# Prometheus (examples)
llm_invocations_total{environment,region,service,component,model_id,outcome}
llm_tokens_input_total{environment,region,service,component,model_id}

# ECS log (examples)
service.name, service.environment, trace.id, span.id
llm.module, llm.function, llm.model_id, llm.flow_id, llm.estimated_cost_usd, llm.outcome

# OTel span
name: llm.gemini.invoke
attributes: llm.model_id, llm.module, llm.function, llm.pass_index

# K8s
labels: app.kubernetes.io/name, app.kubernetes.io/component
annotations: prometheus.io/scrape, prometheus.io/path
```

