## 11. Anti-patterns (do not)

| Don’t | Why |
|-------|-----|
| Prometheus label `user_id` | Millions of series → TSDB death |
| Metric name `llm_cost_service_prod_gemini_flash` | Encode dimensions in name → label explosion across renames |
| Different `service` spelling per system (`voiceapi` vs `voice-api`) | Joins break in unified observability |
| Log field `User` vs `user` vs `USER` | Case chaos in Kibana |

